==Notes==
*The ''[[Battlespire:Battlespire|Battlespire]]'' game engine cannot render the accented E in Papré, so it is displayed in-game as "Papr&nbsp;", including the extraneous space.
*Papré's appearance in ''Battlespire'' predates the creation of the [[Lore:Dragon Language|Dragon language]] for ''[[SR:Skyrim|The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim]]''. Having not been mentioned since ''Battlespire'', it is unknown if Papré can be considered his true name; as such, the name "Papré" has no known translation in the Dragon language and contains only two syllables, rather than the usual three found in most Dragon names.

